#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:3
#: 1358e159b74a49a6865973a30a4cfc10
msgid "Bain 路径（Bain Path）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:5
#: a6f1575c740c4351967f133894cc2c26
msgid "`Group`: `Lattice` | `Class`: `BainPathCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:7
#: d49b4b3524e34373abeab59a70437ca8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:9
#: 984ea7162b954b24b47c28ef3e057dc6
msgid ""
"沿一个指定晶轴做四方畸变，生成一组不同 `c/a` 比的晶胞。它保留原子数和元素组成，只改变晶格矢量，可用于给 bcc/fcc/fct "
"转变、四方相变路径、近似马氏体变形等场景补训练结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:11
#: 6900a6cd6cf143aa8daf8e9b4c7bacb1
msgid ""
"这张卡不是随机扰动卡。它扫描的是晶胞形状自由度：选定 `x`、`y` 或 `z` 作为 c 轴，按 `ca_range` "
"改变该方向长度；`constant_volume` 会同步缩放另外两条轴让体积保持不变，`scale_volume` "
"会在此基础上再扫体积，`free_c` 只改选中轴。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:13
#: 1de5d1d2084b43c2a9f50d22ebb70b0b
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:15
#: 9132190b03864ff1b17f102dc727bf4d
msgid "场景：模型在 bcc 到 fct 变形路径上能量曲线不平滑"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:17
#: 20955be7b32244a7b9ad1577356189c1
msgid ""
"你的 NEP 模型在 bcc Fe 的平衡结构附近力误差很低，但沿 Bain 路径拉伸时能量曲线出现不合理的尖峰。训练集中有平衡 bcc "
"和少量随机应变，却缺少系统的四方畸变结构，模型只能把这条相变路径当外推。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:19
#: bbcf41b3b2ff4dbdbad62195d5fed5f3
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫后的 bcc 或近 bcc 超胞。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:21
#: 07f2c0a396274c0fa94ad5a7ae4b32b3
msgid "**目标：** 在保持体积近似不变的前提下扫描 `c/a = 0.8, 1.0, 1.2`，让模型见过从压扁到拉长的晶胞形状。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:23
#: 8e974cd3e9174766963e98849ac67c88
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:24
#: 7f15daa52845454199315d1b632e77df
msgid "`axis = \"z\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:25
#: 49e5dbbef83e42e58fc476f9260f9d6b
msgid "`ca_range = [0.8, 1.2, 0.2]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:26
#: a1ccc9d516a146819ff2d714e83f62e3
msgid "`mode = \"constant_volume\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:27
#: 4c0d889a4db64829b62abfed822ffbb2
msgid "`scale_atoms = true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:29
#: 3ffebb4d333b4ab097d03dece1f5835b
msgid "**输出：** 3 个结构，带 `Bain(ax=z,ca=...,V=...,mode=constant_volume)` 标签。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:31
#: 4dd73a2e0e35469198a35817d42d07a2
msgid ""
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后重新扫同一 Bain "
"路径，能量曲线应更平滑，峰值位置不应随采样点轻微移动而大幅跳变。如果仍然不稳，缩小步长到 0.05 或在 `scale_volume` "
"模式下给每个 `c/a` 加入 0.95、1.00、1.05 三个体积点。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:33
#: 07a29cccc78b4c568af48077799cbf5a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:35
#: 4800a98c18bb4e0689086c1353d98432
msgid "Axis（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:37
#: e7855ff79f69453bad4fd588c6c162b2
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"z\"`。指定哪条晶格矢量当作 Bain 路径里的 c 轴。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:39
#: ca6f4a9928cb4d80979eed8e54545b5e
msgid ""
"选 `z` 最常见，因为很多输入结构已经把相变或薄膜方向放在第三条晶格矢量。若你的候选畸变方向实际沿 x 或 "
"y，直接切换即可；不要先手动换轴再跑卡片，那样更容易把后续标签和结构方向搞混。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: b9eaaa6ed22d471aac06399df9c594d3 c49b8dcb00fc4eea94b92b77e41ba69d
msgid "选项"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 119790fb59a14f178a4a398030eef4e6 bafc5b62e52b488aaefeba4cb137fa60
msgid "含义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 344b6d46704047edb855f3e42303ebb9 f035290783724bba84f09785cfad3c52
msgid "什么时候选"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: b95405c536be459db0e752a41e4f1639
msgid "`x`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 0ebfb3bcbee544da987db10c9ac7f544
msgid "缩放第一条晶格矢量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 89b297da7d444d57a049e8d4cebd2e5f
msgid "变形方向沿 a 轴"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: bd73672a10b14e6f8c8b670bf65e2ad9
msgid "`y`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 87dc7de985db48bb8558bf7e4b4eb0cb
msgid "缩放第二条晶格矢量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 797901ed01154ef7acd57086f7d320d0
msgid "变形方向沿 b 轴"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 15641f920e8b46a9adeddd78c4da9ef0
msgid "`z`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 281f6452c0c241aeab9a3f9e43eda7e8
msgid "缩放第三条晶格矢量"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: de16a06dbbaa4d39b2265fe6382c2030
msgid "变形方向沿 c 轴，默认选择"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:47
#: e54ef2f70ac34e6cbf390c6aeb97a291
msgid "CA Range（ca_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:49
#: ec429b0f8dba4039bb95495973e4ff52
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`。格式是 `[起点, 终点, "
"步长]`，扫描选中轴的相对缩放因子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:51
#: 8498252d7fee422d9ad281a3e5db2526
msgid ""
"`1.0` 表示原始晶胞；`0.9` 是选中轴压短 10%；`1.1` 是拉长 10%。如果只是补近平衡响应，`0.95-1.05` "
"通常够用；研究 bcc/fcc/fct 路径时可以扩到 `0.7-1.4`，但每批输出都要检查最近邻距离和体积是否仍在你愿意做 DFT 的范围内。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:53
#: d3cb1b6ba1044cb4a1792d94bd93d1b3
msgid "Mode（mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:55
#: 621f24b733b44ddd8b8c2d56cba01f95
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"constant_volume\"`。决定选中轴变化时，另外两条轴和总体积怎么处理。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 6a58acfad5f0435095218c610b58e1e3
msgid "`constant_volume`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 66b03dce3c544dca8311bbf5f66f0e44
msgid "选中轴乘以 `r`，另外两轴乘以 `1/sqrt(r)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 5e06cadb9a4741998df2c4f9225cc35d
msgid "想隔离形状效应，不想把体积变化混进去"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 5ba9a8f2bd7e4f3a9f8950b13151449c
msgid "`scale_volume`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 83639870e9bc4d48a8c6dffd1ea105b6
msgid "先做 constant-volume Bain，再按 `volume_scale_range` 统一缩放体积"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: d88b51df1b474047b2a95861db344c35
msgid "同时补四方畸变和体积响应"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 50cae19dbfd24790963eac5232b4bacb
msgid "`free_c`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 02691797a19547478955372667cace4a
msgid "只缩放选中轴，另外两轴不动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md
#: 3b2e68a9d4fc40bb99ea60afc635a255
msgid "模拟外延约束或单轴加载"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:63
#: ba265253d3a8444bada1c979c6d34edc
msgid "Volume Scale Range（volume_scale_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:65
#: 64986f406e494133bcbb12bf8dcbc37b
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(1.0, 1.0, 1.0)`。格式是 `[起点, 终点, "
"步长]`，表示输出体积相对原始体积的比例。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:67
#: ceed1b3368c44d99b9c9dbff44ba81f6
msgid ""
"这个参数只在 `mode = \"scale_volume\"` 时生效。比如 `[0.95, 1.05, 0.05]` 会为每个 `c/a` "
"生成 0.95、1.00、1.05 三个体积点；如果 `ca_range` 有 5 个点，总输出就是 15 "
"个结构。范围别一上来开太大，体积和形状同时扫很容易把训练集放大。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:69
#: ca82c426ee434734842b6140fda0b1a4
msgid "生效条件：`mode` 必须是 `scale_volume`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:71
#: ba68614d317d4ceb85221ddeafdbfe8d
msgid "Scale Atoms（scale_atoms）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:73
#: de42c18757164ea090fa3661d2248a22
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后原子随晶胞一起按分数坐标缩放；关闭后保留 Cartesian 坐标，只改 cell。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:75
#: 1c4f52febe6b4534a33ba16219371bd5
msgid "训练集构型生成通常应保持打开，因为这代表结构整体经历晶格畸变。关闭更像是在改周期边界而不是改内部结构，适合少数外延盒子或调试场景；关掉后务必检查原子是否贴近边界或产生异常近邻。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:77
#: a3b06886d41248389a2a20c9708d0789
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:79
#: 45ed96366b874479abae5ae38e23a754
msgid "近平衡四方响应"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:81
#: fde7c1d070bd4266b935d2d9b38676bb
msgid "适合先确认模型对小形变是否平滑，输出 3 个结构。"
msgstr ""

