#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:135
#: 2350f3d740f74e97ac0ebea59e66a5f9
msgid "`Bain Path` → `Atomic Perturb`：先补系统四方畸变，再给每个形变点加入小坐标扰动，覆盖非零温局域环境。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:136
#: 2d9f48c8bd934dedb8c0913a1d2a0cbd
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Bain Path`：先扩胞再扫路径，避免小胞里单个缺陷或磁序周期过短。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:137
#: dbcb87744cfd4839a6c99ffb1c9eefe3
msgid "`Bain Path` → `Lattice Strain`：先覆盖相变主路径，再补普通轴向应变，用来稳定弹性响应。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:139
#: 3acdffc3cf8b4b9098a1e9f8ad89411d
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:141
#: d0b2b78653304c52973428c30b8b2a04
msgid "**输出结构数比预期多。** `scale_volume` 会对每个 `c/a` 再乘上每个体积点；总数是两组扫描点数的乘积。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:143
#: 9a4aa339153b4b47bf54980c4b2e6a84
msgid ""
"**体积没有保持不变。** 检查 `mode` 是否为 `constant_volume`。`free_c` "
"会改变体积，`scale_volume` 会按 `volume_scale_range` 继续改体积。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:145
#: 1119a5c0c2b54a7d8d1fe976b4d33fc5
msgid "**结构看起来被拉得太夸张。** 缩小 `ca_range`，先用 `0.95-1.05` 验证模型响应，再决定是否覆盖更宽相变路径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:147
